# UI model pin + default system

For all Batatis UI / frontend / visual / UX **implementation or review**:

- Use **GPT-6.1-Sol at max** for implementation and independent review, following `.cursor/rules/pstack-models.mdc` (user decision 2026-10-23).
- Load `.cursor/skills/batatis-ui-opus/SKILL.md`, `.cursor/skills/batatis-ui-linear/SKILL.md` **and** `.cursor/skills/batatis-ui-minimalist/SKILL.md`.
- Default product look = the light, minimal, mostly monotone calm system in `docs/design-system-calm.md` and `web/src/calm/`; retain Linear P0 interaction rules.
- Apply the user-selected model profile and verify actual delegated model/options.
